  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have completed the full implementation of the **Smart Medical App Ecosystem** following the multi-role, full-stack architecture specification:\n\n### **Ecosystem Overview & Key Capabilities**\n- **Unified Role Switcher (`Navbar.tsx`)**: Allows seamless live preview across all ecosystem perspectives: **Patient**, **Doctor**, **Hospital Admin**, **Ambulance Driver**, **Lab Staff**, **Pharmacy**, and **Super Admin**.\n- **AI Triage & Clinical Decision Engine (`SymptomChecker.tsx`)**:\n  - Leverages server-side Gemini AI calls via `@google/genai` to evaluate symptom severity, compute triage levels (`EMERGENCY_RED`, `URGENT_YELLOW`, `ROUTINE_GREEN`), and suggest recommended clinical specialists.\n- **Biometric Health Risk Analytics (`RiskPrediction.tsx`)**:\n  - Predicts cardiovascular, diabetic, and respiratory risk probabilities with interactive `recharts` visualizers and actionable preventive guidance.\n- **Emergency SOS Dispatch (`EmergencySOSModal.tsx`)**:\n  - Simulates one-touch emergency SOS triggering, broadcasting GPS coordinates, auto-dispatching nearby ALS ambulances, and reserving receiving hospital ICU beds.\n- **Live ICU & Bed Availability Finder (`BedAvailability.tsx`)**:\n  - Real-time search and filter for ICU, Ventilator, Oxygen, and Normal hospital beds with instant pre-registration and direct ER call integration.\n- **Prescription OCR & Drug Interaction Checker (`MedicineManager.tsx`)**:\n  - Multimodal AI vision scanner that extracts medication schedules from prescription photos and cross-checks for adverse drug interactions.\n- **ABHA Digital Health Vault & Lab Diagnostic Reader (`HealthRecordsVault.tsx`)**:\n  - Renders official ABHA Digital Health IDs with QR codes, vital biometrics history, and Gemini AI auto-interpretations of blood panels (HbA1c, Cholesterol, Glucose).\n- **Telemedicine & OPD Booking Portal (`DoctorConsultation.tsx`)**:\n  - OPD slot reservations and simulated high-definition virtual telemedicine video room with camera, microphone, and call controls.\n- **Blood Bank & Organ Donor Mesh (`BloodAndOrganPortal.tsx`)**:\n  - Real-time regional blood unit stock levels with emergency unit request broadcast and digital organ donor pledge cards.\n- **Attending Physician Portal & Smart Digital Referral (`DoctorPortal.tsx`)**:\n  - Doctor clinical desk with Gemini AI automated hospital match recommendations for complex patient transfers and digital referral dispatch.\n- **Hospital Command Desk (`HospitalAdminPortal.tsx`)**:\n  - Real-time bed capacity adjustments, incoming referral approval/rejection desk, and predictive occupancy load charts.\n- **Ambulance Paramedic Terminal (`AmbulanceDriverPortal.tsx`)**:\n  - Live GPS route navigation terminal transmitting patient vitals directly to receiving ER trauma monitors."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
